gninth:N6+, e = 1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wGninthN6pXHX` and `wGninthN6pXGX` (divided by `2 ^
16` and `2 ^ 9`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per column; the
parts evaluate no word image. -/

